<title>USA: Donnelly files for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Donnelly files for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelly Corp said Thursday it had filed an application to list its stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said it had already received preliminary notification from the NYSE that it meets listing standards.</p>
<p>Donnelly, which manufactures automotive glass products, said it expects the listing to become effective early in March.</p>
<p>Donnelly now trades on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
